	(gr_text_box "FABRICATION NOTES (BOTTOM):\n1. NA"
		(start 101.9111 136.5936)
		(end 200.3611 150.1436)
		(margins 1.0025 1.0025 1.0025 1.0025)
		(layer "B.Fab")
		(uuid "2333f550-0ddd-4af3-8efd-6a03acc882e5")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
				(thickness 0.1524)
			)
			(justify left top mirror)
		)
		(border yes)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1)
			(type solid)
		)
		(knockout no)
	)
	(gr_text_box "FABRICATION NOTES\n\n1. FABRICATE PER ANSI/IPC-A-600.IPC-QE-605. IPC-4101.IPC AND\n   IPC-SM-840 SPECIFICATIONS. USE OF ROHS-COMPLIANT\n   MATERIALS ENCOURAGED BUT NOT REQUIRED.\n\n2. MATERIAL: BASE MATERIAL LAMINATED EPOXY GLASS FR04,\n   NOM. 0.062{dblquote} COLOR NATURAL. NOM. 1 OZ COPPER WIEGHT.\n   THICKNESS 0.070{dblquote} MAX AFTER PLATING AND FINISHING. PREFER\n   ROHS COMPLIANT PER IPC-4101 SLASH SHEET #26 OR #83 OR \n   #98 WITH MINIMUM Tg 135 DEGREE C OR HIGHER, Id 300 \n   DEGREE C OR HIGHER AND FLAME RATED UL94V-0.\n\n3. SOLDERMASK BOTH SIDES OF BOARD OVER BARE COPPER WITH\n   MATERIAL PER ANSI/IPC-SM-840. COLOR SHALL BE GREEN.\n\n4. APPLY SOLDER PLATING WITH HOT-AIR LEVELING TP EXPOSED\n   COPPER BOTH SIDES. LEAD-FREE SOLDER PREFERRED, LEADED\n   SOLDER ACCEPTABLE.\n\n5. INDICATED AREA ON BOTTOM SIDE AVAILABLE FOR APPICATION OF\n   PCB MANUFACTURED LOGO, UL MARKING, AND DATE-CODE. USE OF\n   OTHER LOCATION TO BE APPROVED BY PURCHASER.\n\n6. APPLY SILKSCREEN TO TOP AND BOTTOM SIDE OF BOARD USING\n   NON-CONDUCTIVE WHITE EPOXY INK.\n\n7. SEE FABRICATION FILE WITH SAME TITLE OR DRAWING NUMBER, AND\n   REVISION, AS THIS DRAWING.\n\n8. DIMENSIONAL TOLERANCES ARE: .XX = +/- .01; .XXX= +/- .005;\n   ANGLE = 2 DEG.\n\n9. OUTLINE DEFINED IN SEPARATE GERBER FILE WITH {dblquote}.BRD{dblquote} SUFFIX.\n   DIMENSIONS OF CIRCUMSCRIBED RECTANGLE SHOWN ON THIS \n   DRAWING FOR REF ONLY.\n\n10. SEE SEPARATE DRILL FILE FOR HOLE LOCATIONS. SELECTED HOLE\n    LOCATIONS SHOWN ON THIS DRAWING FOR REF ONLY.\n\n11. HOLE LOCATIONS SPECIFIED IN SEPARATE DRILL FILE TAKEN \n    PRECEDENCE OVER THIS DRAWING AND ARTWORK. CONTACT \n    PURCHASER TO RESOLVE DIMENSION CONFLICTS BETWEEN \n    DRAWING AND ARTWORK.\n\n12. HOLE SIZES ARE SPECIFIED AS FINAL DIMENSIONS AFTER PLATING\n    AND FINISHING. UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED ALL HOLES TO BE \n    PLATED.\n\n13. VENDOR TO PLATE HOLES AND EXPOSED PADS. VENDOR TO \n    SPECIFY TYPE OF PLATING MATERIAL TO BE USED WHEN \n    ACCEPTING ORDER.\n\n14. AFTER ASSEMBLY TRIM SOLDER FILLETS AND COMPOMENT LEADS\n    TP 0.06{dblquote} (MAX) BEYOND BOARD SURFACE ON BOTTOM SIDE.\n\n15. DESIGN GEOMETRY MIMIMUM FEATURE SIZES:    [mils, mm] \n    TRACE WIDTH: ANULUS					6.0, 0.1524\n    TRACE-TO-TRACE; TRACE-TO-PAD		6.0, 0.1524\n    HOLE-TO-HOLE						9.8, 0.2489\n    PAD-TO-PAD							9.8, 0.2489\n    SILKSCREEN LINE						6.0, 0.1524\n    SILKSCREEN-TO-BARE COPPER			4.0, 0.1016\n    MINIMUM HOLE SIZE (PLATED)			11.8,0.2997\n    MAXIMUM HOLE SIZE (UNPLATED0)	   125.0, 3.1750\n    BOARD EDGE-TO- COPPER			    12.5, 0.3175"
		(start 14.3111 16.0936)
		(end 87.1111 157.0936)
		(margins 1.0025 1.0025 1.0025 1.0025)
		(layer "F.Fab")
		(uuid "ba5f9fd9-a1cc-4fc7-9aaa-cc22c8bbd5e5")
